@title Drive hoist duty cycle: the run lifts and lowers repeatedly and reports how the winding and the brake heat up (1920x1080)
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Opens the drive hoist fixture, opens Simulate > Drive run and runs the duty cycle with its defaults.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Duty cycle: heat over time"
wait 10
shot duty-form
click_text "Run duty cycle"
wait 600
expect "cycles in"
expect "Winding peak"
check_layout
shot duty-result
